      "mulaIast": "tatrākhaṇḍārthatvalakṣaṇopapattiḥ-\nheyaṃ nirūpya bandhākhyaṃ tannivṛtternibandhanam |\nyajjñānaṃ tadakhaṇḍārthamādeyamadhunocyate ||\n\ntaccākhaṇḍārthaṃ dvividham- evaṃ padārthaniṣṭham, aparaṃ vākyārthaniṣṭham | ekaikaṃ ca punarvaidikalaukikabhedena dvividham | padārthaniṣṭhaṃ vaidikamapi dvividham- tatpadārthaniṣṭhaṃ tvaṃ padārthaniṣṭhaṃ ca | tatra satyaṃ jñānamanantamityādi tatpadārthaniṣṭham | `yo'yaṃ vijñānamayaḥ prāṇeṣu hṛdyantarjyotiḥ puruṣa' ityādi tvaṃ padārthaniṣṭham | `prakṛṣṭaprakāśa' ityādi tu laukikaṃ padārthaniṣṭham | vākyārthaniṣṭhamapi vaidikaṃ `tattvamasyā'divākyam, `so'yaṃ devadatta' ityādi tu laukikam |\n\natrāhuḥ- kimakhaṇḍārthatvam ? na tāvannirbhedārthatvam, yato nirbhedārthatvasya śabdabodhyatve viśeṣaṇatāyāmupalakṣaṇatāyāṃ ca nirghaṭaṃ bhūtalamitivat sakhaṇḍārthataiva syāt śabdābodhyatve tu vastugatyā yannirbhedaṃ brahma tadbodhakasaguṇavākyānāmapi akhaṇḍārthatvāpattiḥ | atha yannirbhedaṃ vastugatyā tanmātraparatvam na | prakṛṣṭaprakāśādivākye'vyāpteḥ, teṣāṃ dharmisamasattākabhedavadvastuparatvena vastugatyā nirbhedārthe niṣṭhatvābhāvāt | ata eva nirviśeṣārthatvamapi na | nāpyaparyāyaśabdānāṃ prātipadikārthamātraparyavasāyitvam śītoṣṇasparśavantau payaḥ pāvakāvityādāvanekaprātipadikārthapare'tivyāpteḥ | na ca saṃbhūyārthaparatvamatra nāstyeva, pratyekaṃ tvekaikārthaparatvaṃ lakṣaṇavākyatvāditi nātivyāptiriti vācyam, tathāpi brahmaṇyabhāvād, abhidhayā lakṣaṇayā vā vedāntavākyānāṃ niḥsambandhe brahmaṇi paryavasānānupapaceḥ | ata eva naikaviśeṣyaparatvamapi, tadviśiṣṭaikaviśeṣyabodhakanīlotpalādivākye ativyāpteriṣṭāpatteśca | yattu- aparyāyaśabdānāṃ saṃsargāgocarapramitijanakatvaṃ vā teṣāmekaprātipadikārthamātraparyavasāyitvaṃ vā akhaṇḍārthatvam | taduktaṃ pañcapādikākṛdbhiḥ- `padānāṃ parasparānavacchinnārthānām ananyākāṅkṣāṇām avyatiriktaikarasaprātipadikārthamātrānvayaḥ' iti | uktañca tattvapradīpikākṛdbhiḥ-\nsaṃsargāsaṅgisamyagdhīhetutā yā girāmiyam |\nuktā'khaṇḍārthatā yadvā tatprātipadikārthatā || iti |\n\ntanna, ādye `aprāptayoḥ prāptiḥ saṃyoga' ityādau saṃyogalakṣaṇavākye'vyāpteḥ | atha padasmāritapadārthasaṃsargāpramāpakatvaṃ vivakṣitam, tatrāpi `dviṣadannaṃ na bhoktavya' mityetatpare `viṣaṃ bhuṅkṣveti vākye ativyāptiḥ | na ca- `dviṣadannaṃ na bhoktavya'miti śāstramūlatvena śāstrīyapadasmāritapadārthasaṃsargapramāpakatvādatra nātivyāptiriti vācyam, yuktimūlatvenāsya śāstramūlatvāsiddheḥ | atha pratipipādayiṣitapadārthasaṃsargāpramāpakatvamatra vivakṣitam, tatrāpyasaṃbhavaḥ, candrabrahmādiśabdārthānāṃ svarūpato jñātatayā'pratipipādayiṣitatvena saṃsarga viśeṣapratiyogitvenaiva pratipipādayiṣitatvāt | ata eva na dvitīyalakṣaṇamapi, tathā ca lakṣaṇāsambhavāt pramāṇamapyasaṃbhavi, alakṣite pramāṇasyopanyasitumaśakyatvād iti |\n\natrocyate- padavṛttismāritātiriktamatra saṃsargapadena vivakṣitam | tathā cāparyāyaśabdānāṃ padavṛttismāritātiriktāgocarapramājanakatvamādyalakṣaṇaṃ paryavasitam | tathā ca na saṃyogalakṣaṇe avyāptiḥ, tasya padavṛttismāritatvāt | nāpi dviṣannabhojananiṣedhake ativyāptiḥ, tatrāniṣṭasādhanatvasaṃsargasya padavṛttyasmāritasya pratipādyatvāt | `śītoṣṇasparśavantau payaḥ pāvakā' vityatra tvakhaṇḍārthatvamiṣṭameva | na ca - dharmadharmibhāvāsahamakhaṇḍārthatvaṃ kathaṃ dharmibhedaṃ sahatāmiti- vācyam, ekatrāsahiṣṇutāyāḥ sarvatrā sahiṣṇutāyāmahetutvāt, śītasparśavat payaḥ, uṣṇasparśavān pāvaka iti vākyārthabhedācca | asaṃbhavastu tanmātrapraśnottaratvāditi hetvasiddhyuddhāre nirasiṣyate | atra ca `ghaṭaḥ kalaśa'ityādau saṃsargāpramāpake ekārthapare'tivyāptivāraṇāyāparyāyaśabdānāmiti | tatrāpi bahuvacanena saṃbhūyaikārthapratipādakatvasya lābhānna`dhavakhadirapalāśā' ityādāvativyāptiḥ | padajñāpyetyukte arthāpattyā padajñāpyamaniṣṭasādhanatvamādāya `viṣaṃ bhuṅkṣveti vākye ativyāptiḥ syāttadvāraṇāya vṛttīti | tathāpyanvitābhidhānavādimate śaktyā'bhihitānvayavādimate ca lakṣaṇayā vākyārthabhūtasaṃsargasya vṛttijñāpyatvāt sarvatra pramāṇavākye ativyāptiḥ syāttadvāraṇāya uktaṃ smāriteti | ādyapakṣe kubjaśaktyaṅgīkārād, dvitīyapakṣe cājñātāyā eva padārthaniṣṭhāyā lakṣaṇāyā vṛttitvāṅgīkārāt na saṃsargasya padasmāritatvam, kiṃtvanubhāvyatvamityativyāptiparihāraḥ | evaṃ dvitīyamapi lakṣaṇaṃ samyageva | tatrāpyekatvaṃ prātipadikārthasyaikadharmāvacchedena vṛttiviṣayatvam, na tvekamātra vyaktitvam | ato yaugikārthaupagavādipraśnottare `śyāmo dīrghaḥ lohitākṣa aupagava' ityādau anekārthātmake vanasenādipraśnottare ekadeśasthā vṛkṣā vanamityādau ca nāvyāptiḥ | `śītoṣṇasparśavantau payaḥpāvakā'viti tu pratyekamekaikārthaparatvāt saṅgrāhyameva | taduktaṃ kalpatarukṛdbhiḥ-\naviśiṣṭaparyāyānekaśabdaprakāśitam |\nevaṃ vedāntaniṣṇātā akhaṇḍaṃ pratipedire || iti |\n\nnanu pravṛttinimittabhede aparyāyatvam, sa cānantādipadeṣu na saṃbhavati, śuddhabrahmamātraniṣṭhatvād, ato vedānteṣu lakṣaṇāvyāptiriti cenna, pravṛttinimittabhedaṃ svīkṛtyaiva lakṣaṇayā'nantādipadānāṃ śuddhabrahmaparatvasya vakṣyamāṇatvāt | na ca śuddhe saṃbandhābhāvānna lakṣaṇāpīti vācyam | atātvikasaṃbandhenaiva lakṣaṇopapatteḥ | bhramapratītarajatatvena saṃbandhena śuktau rajata padalakṣaṇāvat | śuddhasyaiva sarvakalpanāspadatvena śuddhe na kalpitasaṃbandhānupapattiḥ | yathā cānantādipadānāṃ lākṣaṇikatve'pi brahmaṇi nāntavattvādiprasaṅgaḥ tathā vakṣyate | ityadvaitasiddhau akhaṇḍārthalakṣaṇopapattiḥ || 1 ||"
