      "mulaIast": "evaṃ lakṣaṇasaṃbhave pramāṇasaṃbhavo'pi tathā hi- satyādivākyamakhaṇḍārthaniṣṭhaṃ, brahmaprātipadikārthaniṣṭhaṃ vā, lakṣaṇavākyatvāt tanmātrapraśnottaratvādvā, prakṛṣṭa prakāśaścandra iti vākyavaditi padārthaviṣayākhaṇḍārthatvānumānam | tattvamasyādi vākyamakhaṇḍārthaniṣṭhamātmasvarūpamātraniṣṭhaṃ vā, akāryakāraṇadravyamātraniṣṭhatve sati samānādhikaraṇatvāt, tanmātrapraśnottaratvādvā, so'yamityādivākyavaditi vākyārthaviṣayākhaṇḍārthatvānumānam, na ca satyādivākye tanmātrapraśnottaratvamasiddham; `brahmavidāpnoti paramiti brahmavedanasyaiveṣṭasādhanatayā tanmātra eva bubhutsātaḥ tanmātrasyaiva praśnaviṣayatvāt | na ca prakṛṣṭādivākye sādhyavaikalyam; tadvākyaṃ pakṣīkṛtya tanmātra praśnottaratvena candramātraniṣṭhatāyāḥ sāmānyavyāptimavalambya sādhanāt | evaṃ `tattvamasyā'divākye'pi tanmātrapraśnottaratvaṃ nāsiddham, `ko'ha'mityātmasvarūpasyaiva praśnaviṣayatvena tadadhikapratyukterayukteḥ | nāpyatra dṛṣṭāntāsiddhiḥ, devadattasvarūpamātre pṛṣṭe asya pravṛtteḥ | na cāprayojakatvam, praśnottarayorvaiyadhikaraṇyāpatteḥ, vipakṣabādhakatarkasya vidyamānatvāt | na ca- saṃsargāgocarapramitijanakatvaṃ sādhyamaprasiddham, pratyakṣādināpi idamitthamiti viśeṣasaṃsargagocarāyā eva pramiterjananāditi vācyam, nirvikalpakasvīkartṝṇāṃ tasminneva prasiddheḥ, itareṣāṃ tu pramātvaṃ saṃsargāgocaravṛtti, sakalapramāvṛttitvādabhidheyatvavaditi sāmānyatastatprasiddheḥ | yadyapyatrāpi aprayojakatvaṃ saṃbhāvyate tathāpi sandeharūpā sādhyaprasiddhirna durlabhā | vastutastu prakṛṣṭādivākya eva tatprasiddhirdarśitā |\n\nna ca- lakṣaṇavākyatvaṃ satyādivākyeṣvasiddham, satyatvādeḥ parāparajātitayā tasyāścānyatrāpi vidyamānatvenāsādhāraṇyābhāvāt, na ca- tāttvikaṃ tad brahmaṇi, advaitaśrutivirodhād, ātattvikaṃ tvanyatrāpi tulyamiti- vācyam, paramārthasatyādirūpatāyāḥ brahmasvarūpalakṣaṇatvāt | asmanmate yadyapi satyādyanyatamapadaṃ svarūpalakṣaṇaparam, brahmaṇo'nyasya tadabhāsatvāt, tathāpi parairapi satyatvasya satyatve sati jñānatvasya satyatve satyānandatvasya śūnyavādibhirapi sattvarahitajñānāndātmakatvasya brahmaṇo'nyatrāṅgīkārānmilitaṃ vinā na nirvicikitsabrahmasiddhiriti militaṃ lakṣaṇam | na caivaṃ viśiṣṭasya lakṣaṇatve sakhaṇḍārthatvaprasaṅgaḥ, vācyasya sakhaṇḍārthatve'pi lakṣyasyākhamḍatvāt | yadyapi sarveṣāṃ satyādipadānāṃ lakṣyamekameva nirviśeṣaṃ brahma, tathāpi nivartanīyāṃśādhikyena na padāntaravaiyarthyam | ato vācyārtha vaiśiṣṭyasyākhaṇḍasiddhāvupāyatvāt na tadvirodhitā |\n\nnanu idaṃ viruddham asādhāraṇadharmarūpalakṣaṇaparavākyasya sakhaṇḍārthatvaniyamāditi- cet, na, sarvalakṣaṇavākyānāṃ svarūpamātraparyavasāyitvena niyamāsiddheḥ dharmalakṣaṇasyākhaṇḍatvavirodhitve'pi svarūpalakṣaṇasya tadavirodhitvācca | na cābhede lakṣyalakṣaṇabhāvāyogaḥ, antaḥkaraṇavṛttinibandhanākārabhedena ubhayopapatteḥ, āvṛtattvānāvṛtatvavad, anyathā svarūpalakṣaṇataṭasthalakṣaṇavibhāgo na syāt | na ca yāvaddravyabhāvitvābhāvitvābhyāṃ vyavasthā, tāvatā hi sthāyitvāsthāyitvavyavasthā syāt, na tu svarūpādirūpā, tava mate pārthivarūpādau svarūpalakṣaṇe avyāpteśca, brahmaṇi yāvaddravyabhāvidharmavirahācca | vastutastu- dvāratvena lakṣaṇe tātparyaṃ na dvāriṇo'khaṇḍārthatvaṃ viruṇaddhi | na ca- svarūpajñānasya prāgeva sāmānyato jātatvāt tajjñāne naitaddvārāpekṣeti vācyam, jñānamātre'sya dvāratvābhāve'pi saṃśayādinivartakaitajjñāne taddbārāpekṣaṇāt | na ca sakhaṇḍavanādilakṣaṇavākye vyabhicāraḥ, tatrāpi sādhyasattvasya vyutpādanāt | na ca kiṃ candralakṣaṇamityasādhāraṇadharmapraśnottare prakṛṣṭaprakāśādivākye vyabhicāraḥ | tatra hi na candrasvarūpaparatvam, kintu prakarṣāśrayo yaḥ prakāśaḥ, tatsvarūpaparatvam, tathā ca prakarṣopalakṣitaprakāśavyaktisvarūpamātrapratipādakatvena tatrāpyakhaṇḍārthatvāvirodhāt | ata eva- dharme pṛṣṭe candrasvarūpaṃ vaktuṃ nocitamiti-nirastam, dharmasyaiva svarūpata uktatvād, anyathā praśnottarayorvaiyadhikaraṇyāpatteḥ |\n\nnanu- idaṃ bādhitam, dharmijñānādhīnasaprakārakasaṃśayādinivartakaṃ mokṣahetuṃ saprakārakajñānaṃ prati sādhanatvena vedāntavicāravidhānānyathānupapattyā vedāntavākye sādhyābhāvaniścayāditi cenna, anṛtādipratiṣedhakavyāvṛttākārajñānenaiva anṛtādisaṃśayādinivṛttyupapatteranyathāsiddhatvāt | na hi saprakārakatvamātraṃ tatra tantram | bhramakālīnānuvṛttākārajñānasya saprakārakatvena saṃśayādinivartakatve bhramakathaivocchidyeta | jñānasyājñānasamaviṣayatvenaiva tannivartakatvam, na tu samānaprakārakatvenāpi gauravāt | ajñānaviṣayaścaśuddhaṃ brahma ajñānakalpitasya taditarasya ajñāna viṣayatvāyogāt | tathā ca śuddha brahmākārā cittavṛttiḥ niṣprakārikaivājñānanivartikāprakāramātrasyāvidyākalpitatvena tadviṣayatāyāṃ vṛtteravidyāsamaviṣayatvābhāvāt | yathā cāvidyātatkāryaviṣayaṃ jñānaṃ tadanivartakaṃ tathā vyutpāditaṃ prāk | dravyādyākārajñānānāṃ ca ghaṭādyākāratvasyānubhavanirastatvānna dravyādyākārajñānena ghaṭādyākārājñānanivṛttiprasaṅgaḥ, dravyatvaghaṭatvayorbhedena viṣayabhedācca | yathā ca samānaprakārakatvamādāyāpi na nistāraḥ, tathā pratipāditamasmābhirvedāntakalpalatikāyāmiti dik |"
